== brief 10: group results by page (branch fase3-interfaz)

what changed: retrieval/search.py group_by_url -> group_by_page (key = url without
#anchor; representative = best ranked fragment, its url keeps its own anchor;
chunk_ids = every candidate fragment of the page in rank order; new 'urls' field;
page_url = the grouping key; group score = best fragment's rrf, not the sum).
eval/__main__.py: first_hit()/first_hit_rank() take the search results and match an
expected #anchor against any fragment of the group (page-level expectations unchanged);
rows now carry hit_url and top_group_urls.

command: .venv/bin/python -m eval --strict
command: .venv/bin/python -m eval --compare --strict
python: 3.12.3 (venv) / corpus untouched

