reading:
- downweight (the shipped default): no answerable question changed rank at all, so
  recall@5 and MRR@8 are identical; the gain is the result list (see the duplicate
  page section below).
- baseline and plain: a12 moved from rank 6 to 5, i.e. one more Spanish question
  inside top-5 (recall@5 all 0.86 -> 0.88).
- es-stopwords+downweight: a42 moved from 7 to 5 (same effect, different question).
- plain+downweight and es-stopwords: only small MRR moves (a42 7 -> 6 and back).
- no question got worse under any policy, and none fell out of top-5.

