== limits

- Only the downweight policy is versioned in eval/reports/retrieval.json (as before);
  the other rows of the per-policy table come from the --compare run above.
- The generation numbers in the README are still the phase 2 mock run: there is no
  real generation report, so grouping did not change them.
- 'before' was reproduced by monkeypatching the pre-brief grouping (git HEAD) in the
  same process and corpus, not by re-running an old binary.
- 0 of the 80 questions carry an expected URL with an #anchor (grep -c 'expected_urls.*#'
  eval/questions.jsonl = 0), so the secondary-fragment rule only runs in the tests; what
  moved the numbers here is page-level matching plus no repeated pages.
